<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AlumniConnect — University Alumni & Career Network</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-canvas: #F8FAFC;
      --bg-surface: #FFFFFF;
      --bg-subtle: #F1F5F9;
      --text-primary: #0F172A;
      --text-secondary: #475569;
      --text-muted: #94A3B8;
      --brand-primary: #4F46E5;
      --brand-primary-hover: #4338CA;
      --brand-accent: #0284C7;
      --status-success-bg: #DCFCE7;
      --status-success-fg: #166534;
      --status-warning-bg: #FEF3C7;
      --status-warning-fg: #92400E;
      --status-info-bg: #E0E7FF;
      --status-info-fg: #3730A3;
      --status-danger-bg: #FFE4E6;
      --status-danger-fg: #BE123C;
      --border-subtle: #E2E8F0;
      --font-display: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: var(--bg-canvas);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .site-nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .brand-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-primary), var(--brand-accent));
      color: white;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--text-primary);
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    .nav-links a.active {
      background: #EEF2FF;
      color: var(--brand-primary);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 36px 24px 64px;
      width: 100%;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .hero-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E1B4B 60%, #1E3A8A 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 48px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: #E0E7FF;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.18;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      color: #CBD5E1;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--brand-primary);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--brand-primary-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-glass {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    }
    .btn-glass:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .stat-value {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .stat-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .section-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .modules-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(310px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .module-card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }
    .module-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
      border-color: #CBD5E1;
    }
    .module-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .module-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .module-card p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 14.5px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .module-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    .route-pill {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .module-link {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--brand-primary);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .module-link:hover { color: var(--brand-primary-hover); }
    .site-footer {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .site-footer a {
      color: var(--brand-primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="site-nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">
        <span class="brand-mark">🎓</span>
        <span>AlumniConnect</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/" class="active">Home</a>
        <a href="/users">Users</a>
        <a href="/announcements">Announcements</a>
        <a href="/job-postings">Job Postings</a>
        <a href="/applications">Applications</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/api/swagger">Swagger API</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero-card">
      <span class="hero-badge">✨ University Alumni & Career Ecosystem</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Bridging Academic Heritage with Lifelong Career Impact.</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Manage graduate directories, publish institutional bulletins, explore curated career opportunities, and track candidate applications—backed by Express MVC & MySQL.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/job-postings" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Job Postings →</a>
        <a href="/users" class="btn btn-glass">Browse Users Directory</a>
        <a href="/api/swagger" class="btn btn-glass">OpenAPI / Swagger Docs</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Registered Users</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.users %></div>
        <div class="stat-meta">GET /api/users</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Active Job Postings</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.jobs %></div>
        <div class="stat-meta">GET /api/job-postings</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Submitted Applications</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.applications %></div>
        <div class="stat-meta">GET /api/applications</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Campus Announcements</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.announcements %></div>
        <div class="stat-meta">GET /api/announcements</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Platform Modules & Interfaces</h2>
    </div>

    <section class="modules-grid">
      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #EEF2FF; color: #4F46E5;">👥</div>
          <h3>Users Directory & Profiles</h3>
          <p>Full MVC CRUD interface for managing alumni and administrative user accounts, plus nested user job postings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/users</span>
          <a href="/users" class="module-link">Manage Users →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #E0F2FE; color: #0284C7;">💼</div>
          <h3>Career & Job Postings</h3>
          <p>Browse and publish full-time, internship, and remote roles from hiring partners with domain validation guardrails.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/job-postings</span>
          <a href="/job-postings" class="module-link">View Jobs →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #DCFCE7; color: #166534;">📋</div>
          <h3>Candidate Applications</h3>
          <p>Track candidate submissions linked to job postings and transition statuses across Pending, Reviewing, Accepted, and Rejected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/applications</span>
          <a href="/applications" class="module-link">Review Pipeline →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #FEF3C7; color: #92400E;">📢</div>
          <h3>Campus Announcements</h3>
          <p>Publish and manage institutional bulletins categorized under Event, Career, Mentorship, and General notices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/announcements</span>
          <a href="/announcements" class="module-link">Read Bulletins →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #F1F5F9; color: #0F172A;">📖</div>
          <h3>Interactive Swagger Docs</h3>
          <p>Inspect and test all REST API endpoints, request schemas, and direct/nested routes via OpenAPI 3.0 Swagger UI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/api/swagger</span>
          <a href="/api/swagger" class="module-link">Launch Swagger →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="module-card">
        <div>
          <div class="module-icon" style="background: #FFE4E6; color: #BE123C;">🩺</div>
          <h3>Architecture & Health</h3>
          <p>Learn about the AlumniConnect brand identity, DESIGN.md specification, and inspect live MySQL health metrics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module-footer">
          <span class="route-pill">/about · /api/health</span>
          <a href="/about" class="module-link">About System →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    AlumniConnect — University Alumni & Career Network · Built with Express.js, EJS, MySQL & Docker ·
    <a href="/about">About</a> · <a href="/api/health">API Health</a> · <a href="/api/swagger">Swagger UI</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
